cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Attractor Observatory"
abstract: >-
  A substrate-neutral computational research instrument for discovering recurring
  stable energy-information attractors across artificial worlds, biology, and
  computation. Built collaboratively by multiple AI agents under a binding
  doctrine that treats "AI builders silently degrading their own scientific
  rigor" as a measurable, preventable failure mode.

message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."

