    alias: "Architect"
    # Architecture, contracts, schemas, validation plans, doctrine,
    # risk register, audits, campaign drivers (v1.1, v1.2, Campaigns 002-009).

  - name: "GPT (OpenAI)"
    alias: "Theorist"
    # Original seed, theoretical sharpening, methodological pushback,
    # research strategy (v1.0, Seed v1.2).

  - name: "Codex (OpenAI)"
    alias: "Builder"
    # Implementation: substrate engines (W1-W13), trace plane, AI Operating
    # System scaffold, calibration corpora (K1-K10), null factory,
    # validation gauntlet, atlas seed, reproducibility scripts.
    # Architect-grade contributions: Doctrine D18 (no equivalence-basis drift).

